<title>USA: TABLE- Avert Inc Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Avert Inc Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>FORT COLLINS, Colo. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>EARNINGS RECAP	Second Quarter Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					June 30,	   June 30,</p>
<p>				1997	1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>				    (unaudited)	 (unaudited)</p>
<p> Revenue	    $2,458,400 $irman Craven Crowell at a board</p>
<p>meeting in Chattanooga.</p>
<p>Crowell called the price increase &quot;the best business decision for TVA.&quot;  He said implementing recommendations in the financial plan will &quot;preserve TVA as a national asset.&quot;</p>
<p>TVA said it is the nation's largest producer of electricity, and noted its power system is self-financed.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
